{"id": "en_desert_car_p1", "total": 66.57, "segments": [{"text": "If your car breaks down in the desert heat, do not try to walk for help.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.18}, {"text": "Jake stands beside his smoking car as scorching desert air hits him at midday.", "start": 3.92, "end": 7.34}, {"text": "Extreme heat rises off dry sand, creating a deadly trap with zero shade nearby.", "start": 7.92, "end": 11.94}, {"text": "He has 1 main goal: survive until search teams spot him in this wasteland.", "start": 12.58, "end": 16.14}, {"text": "One. Stay directly with your vehicle because a car is much easier to spot.", "start": 16.66, "end": 20.24}, {"text": "Jake raises the hood to signal overhead planes and keeps his phone put away.", "start": 21.04, "end": 24.08}, {"text": "He keeps his phone saved for the exact moment he gets a cell signal.", "start": 24.58, "end": 27.48}, {"text": "Two. Rest in the shade during the hottest hours of the dry desert day.", "start": 28.06, "end": 31.66}, {"text": "Jake walks to shelter under a big rock to escape the direct scorching sun.", "start": 32.5, "end": 35.38}, {"text": "If he must move, he will only travel early morning or late evening.", "start": 35.94, "end": 38.9}, {"text": "Three. Drink your water when thirsty without saving every drop for much later.", "start": 39.48, "end": 43.66}, {"text": "Rationing water while you overheat in the extreme desert sun does not help.", "start": 44.36, "end": 47.18}, {"text": "Jake drinks his water, sits near shade, and uses a mirror to flash light.", "start": 47.98, "end": 51.038}, {"text": "He waves his arms high into the air, signaling clearly near his shaded spot.", "start": 51.42, "end": 54.68}, {"text": "It was the perfect plan, and Jake followed every rule to survive desert heat.", "start": 55.22, "end": 58.84}, {"text": "There was just one problem: the sun shifted, pushing all shade away into scorching heat.", "start": 59.32, "end": 63.42}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.3], ["your", 0.3, 0.4],